### Quick Settings Scope Expansion

The master plan specified "Lock PC" tile only. The user authorized expanding scope to include 8 tiles:
Lock, Shutdown, Restart, Restart to UEFI, Wake on LAN, Sleep, Hibernate, Monitor Off. All tile services
use the unlockAndRun {} wrapper (BLOCKER-4 fix): Hibernate, Restart, Shutdown, Sleep had it already;
Lock, MonitorOff, RestartUefi, and WakeOnLan were updated in the 2026-05-09 audit remediation pass.
Tiles that existed pre-audit (RestartUefi, WakeOnLan) are tracked here for completeness.

